# Preserve published bytes exactly. Release manifests and SHA-256 values govern content.
* -text

# Retain readable Git/GitHub diffs without line-ending normalization.
*.md diff
*.sql diff
*.csv diff
*.json diff
*.txt diff
*.yml diff
*.yaml diff
*.cff diff

# Binary publication artifacts.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.pbix binary
